   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Podpora financovania IDA oper&#xe1;ci&#xed;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;One-off financial transfer to support IDA activities.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The contribution will be used primarily to cover the topics of governance and institutions, climate change and migration. Geographically, it will be mostly focused on post-Soviet countries and MENA region.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Jednor&#xe1;zov&#xfd; transfer prostriedkov v prospech IDA.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;spevok SR bude vyu&#x17e;it&#xfd; najm&#xe4; na t&#xe9;my: riadenie a in&#x161;tit&#xfa;cie a klimatick&#xe9; zmeny a migr&#xe1;cia a geograficky predov&#x161;etk&#xfd;m na pre b&#xfd;val&#xe9; krajiny Sovietskeho zv&#xe4;zu a regi&#xf3;n MENA.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
